 WIDTH: 408.22pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 190.71pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">？ 학생 1인당 1회에 한하여 분야별 인재인증기준 충족자에게 포상금 지급 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">(200,000원/선착순 60명)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">？ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">인증기준에 따라 인재인증을 취득하였을 경우 해당 학생의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">학적부 및</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">성적기록부에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">표시</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">하며, 4가지 인재인증 기준을 모두 충족 할 경우</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">“kit 명품인재”로 표시</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family